FP (c). Overexpression and coinfiltration of virulent Avr3a KI and avirulentAvr3a EM with the potato <italic>R</italic> gene R3a are shown in (d). Naturally occurring PVXresistance in <italic>S. papita</italic> (e) and the recognitionof virulent Avr3a KI and avirulent Avr3a EM alleles but not from tdT, used as acontrol, in <italic>S. chacoense</italic> (f).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IJPG2008-216513.001"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>